<title>FINLAND: VIKING LINE 96 PASSENGER VOLUME UP 0.4 PCT.</title>
<headline>VIKING LINE 96 PASSENGER VOLUME UP 0.4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator</p>
<p>Viking Line Ab said in a statement on Tuesday the number of</p>
<p>passengers carried in full-year 1996 rose 0.4 percent to 4.57</p>
<p>million.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PASSENGERS				 1996	    1995  change%</p>
<p> Turku/Naantali-Mariehamn-     2,221,930     2,248,504   -1.2%</p>
<p>Stockholm/Kapellskar</p>
<p> - of which Aland traffic	  763,370	 694,433   +9.9%</p>
<p> Helsinki-Stockholm		1,096,939     1,034,138   +6.1%</p>
<p> Helsinki-Tallinn/Muuga	  1,250,862     1,266,723   -1.3%</p>
<p> TOTAL				 4,569,731     4,549,365   +0.4%</p>
<p> CARS				    368,318	 371,505   -0.9%</p>
<p> CARGO UNITS			    69,357	  75,644   -8.3%</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
</text>
